@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@visitorAccessToken =
@otherVisitorAccessToken =
@sessionId =
@soldOutSessionId =
@startedSessionId =
@holdId =
@expiredHoldId =
@reservationId =
@checkedInReservationId =
@confirmIdempotencyKey = confirm-{{$uuid}}
@confirmConflictIdempotencyKey = confirm-conflict-{{$uuid}}

# P0 예약 홀드/확정/내 예약/취소
# 선행 조건: PUBLISHED 콘텐츠의 SCHEDULED 회차와 잔여 정원이 필요하다.

### 1. 공개 회차 정보 확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. 홀드 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("holdId", response.body.data.holdId);
%}

### 3. sessionId 형식 오류 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "not-number",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 4. quantity 0 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 5. 정원 부족 - 409 RESERVATION_HOLD_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{soldOutSessionId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 6. 회차 시작 후 홀드 - 409 RESERVATION_HOLD_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{startedSessionId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. 예약 확정
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservation-holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{confirmIdempotencyKey}}
Accept: application/json

> {%
client.global.set("reservationId", response.body.data.reservationId);
client.global.set("reservationNo", response.body.data.reservationNo);
%}

### 8. 예약 확정 반복 - 같은 응답 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservation-holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{confirmIdempotencyKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. 같은 Idempotency-Key 다른 hold 요청 - 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservation-holds/{{expiredHoldId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{confirmIdempotencyKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Idempotency-Key 누락 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservation-holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. 만료 홀드 확정 - 409 RESERVATION_CONFIRM_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservation-holds/{{expiredHoldId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{confirmConflictIdempotencyKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. 내 예약 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. 내 예약 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. 타인 예약 상세 조회 - 403 FORBIDDEN 기대
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherVisitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. 예약 취소
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. 예약 취소 반복 - 기존 취소 응답 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 17. 체크인된 예약 취소 - 409 RESERVATION_CANCEL_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/reservations/{{checkedInReservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

# DB 확인
# SELECT hold_id, user_id, content_session_id, quantity, status, expires_at FROM capacity_hold WHERE hold_id IN ({{holdId}}, {{expiredHoldId}});
# SELECT reservation_id, reservation_no, user_id, content_session_id, status, cancelled_at FROM reservation WHERE reservation_id IN ({{reservationId}}, {{checkedInReservationId}});
# SELECT session_id, remaining_capacity FROM content_session WHERE session_id IN ({{sessionId}}, {{soldOutSessionId}}, {{startedSessionId}});
# SELECT operation, result_code, result_reservation_id, status FROM idempotency_record WHERE operation = 'RESERVATION_CONFIRM' ORDER BY idempotency_record_id DESC;
# SELECT audit_event_id, target_type, target_id, result, reason_code FROM audit_event WHERE target_id IN ({{holdId}}, {{reservationId}}) ORDER BY audit_event_id DESC;
